    "body": "Thanks for catching that! Those are not the intended semantics. Server-Timing + Timing-Allow-Origin is the opt-in to get Server-Timing data (and how implementations currently work AFAIK).\r\n\r\nWhat's the best way to fix that? Attach the Server-Timing value to the response further up the chain (e.g. before step 13 of Main Fetch)?",
